OL,3,GNEWSARefugee medic rebuilds his career
OL,4,Ain ultrasound unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA refugee medic who fled from
OL,7,Fimprisonment and persecution in Sudan
OL,8,Fto settle in north-east England has
OL,9,Frebuilt his career by volunteering at
OL,10,Fthe town's hospital.
OL,12,FAhmed Bakheet, 40, feared he would
OL,13,Fnever be able to use his skills and
OL,14,Ftraining again after ending up homeless
OL,15,Fand barred from working while waiting
OL,16,Ffor his asylum case to be processed.
OL,18,FBut after being granted refugee status
OL,19,Fin 2025, he began volunteering at North
OL,20,FTees Hospital in his new home town of
OL,21,FStockton-on-Tees.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
