OL,3,GNEWSARefugee medic rebuilds his career
OL,4,Ain ultrasound unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis skills were quickly recognised and
OL,7,Fhe is back in paid work as a
OL,8,Fsonographer, using ultrasound to
OL,9,Fperform scans on women in the advanced
OL,10,Fstages of pregnancy. Bakheet said he
OL,11,Fwanted to "give back to this
OL,12,Fcommunity".
